	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『機動戦士Vガンダム』より、MG商品化希望ランキング1位の「V2ガンダム」が、ついに登場！",
			"• 「MG νガンダム Ver.Ka」の装甲拡張ギミックで培った技術を活かし、変形機構を備えながらもプロポーションとの両立を実現！",
			"• 2機のV2コア・ファイターの他、精密射撃用デバイスが付いた頭部、パーツ換装でハンド・ガンやグレネード・ランチャーの再現が可能なビーム・ライフルも付属！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• From \"MOBILE SUIT V GUNDAM\", \"V2 GUNDAM\", which is No. 1 in the MG commercialization ranking is finally here!",
			"• Taking advantage of the technology cultivated in the armor expansion gimmick of the \"MG ν GUNDAM Ver.Ka\", it has a deformation mechanism and achieves both proportions and proportions!",
			"• In addition to two V2 core fighters, a head with a precision shooting device, and a beam rifle that can be reproduced as a hand gun and grenade launcher by replacing parts are also included!"
		]
